AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020217> "DEPRECATED periodic arrangement of structural features up to a few entities"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020217> "DEPRECATED periodische Anordnung von Strukturmerkmalen bis hin zu wenigen Einheiten"@de)
ClassAssertion(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020216> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020217>)

