AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020219> "DEPRECATED periodic arrangement of structural features of virtually all entities"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020219> "DEPRECATED periodische Anordnung struktureller Merkmale praktisch aller Entitäten"@de)
ClassAssertion(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020216> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020219>)

# Individual: <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020242> (DEPRECATED no range order)

