AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020242> "DEPRECATED keine periodische Anordnung struktureller Merkmale von Entitäten"@de)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020242> "DEPRECATED no periodic arrangement of structural features of entites"@en)
ClassAssertion(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020216> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020242>)

